  "details": "When starting up any version of the open beta (Tested on 904 and several others), I get the following message:\n\"Cannot Connect to VRChat Make sure your device has a working internet connection, and restart VRChat\".\nI can connect to the live game fine. For the beta I have tried most of the commonly given advice such as disabling non-essential network devices, using a different DNS (such as 8.8.8.8), etc, but no luck so far.\nThis may just be an issue with my system, but I wanted to log it here in case others are affected.",
